A flush-left line needs an open paragraph to fold into

```
. >
X
.
<ol>
  <li>
    <blockquote>

    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ol>
<p>X</p>
```

```
- >
lazy
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote>

    </blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>lazy</p>
```

```
- > q
lazy
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>q
lazy</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

